+   use of `k_ssb` was `base_sc = ((ssb_start_subcarrier - k_ssb)/12)*12`. For non-negative `start`,
+   `start - (start % 12) == 12*floor(start/12)`, so `floor((start - start%12)/12) == floor(start/12)`
